{"id":79,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"誠実・勤勉・友愛から自立と社会貢献へ","feature_description":"校訓「誠実・勤勉・友愛」を教育の軸とし、6年間で「関わる力」「動く力」「考える力」「解く力」を育て、共立リーダーシップを発揮して人生を切り開く女性を目指します。中学1年から高校1年までは教科に偏らず基礎力を培い、高校2・3年は進路に応じて専門性の高い学力を伸ばす4＋2システムを採用。探究活動や少人数授業、大学との連携も通じて自立と社会貢献を支援します。","clubs":[{"id":818,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":819,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":820,"name":"太極拳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":821,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":822,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":823,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":824,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":825,"name":"バトン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":826,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":827,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":828,"name":"英語部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":829,"name":"茶道部（遠州流・不白流）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":830,"name":"能楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyo